      "message": "fix(app): the spindle speed refusal shows only under the speed fields\n\nThe machine editor gave every Spindle range field the refusal key\n`spindle`. That key holds one refusal: min_speed above max_speed. It\nshowed under Spindle power too. Now only Spindle min speed and Spindle\nmax speed carry it. Spindle power keeps its own `spindle power` key.\n\nFixes #3246\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
